# Headstone Pilgrimage: the fragment held and its quest completed, in the three quest zones. Cape Teriggan
# (Wind Fragment, Wandering Souls) says ALREADY_OBTAINED_FRAG (7691), the Sanctuary of Zi'Tah (Light, Soul
# Searching) 7762 and Yuhtunga Jungle (Fire, Wrath of the Opo-opos) 7702, each with no further action.
# The Zi'Tah zone-in writes Mission[10][6]diggingZone 119 (Zi'Tah's Zone.lua: A Moogle Kupo d'Etat's
# digging helper).
lists CapeTeriggan/Cermet_Headstone/onTrigger CapeTeriggan/onEventFinish/200 CapeTeriggan/onEventFinish/201
lists TheSanctuaryOfZitah/Cermet_Headstone/onTrigger TheSanctuaryOfZitah/onEventFinish/200 TheSanctuaryOfZitah/onEventFinish/201
lists YuhtungaJungle/Cermet_Headstone/onTrigger YuhtungaJungle/onEventFinish/200 YuhtungaJungle/onEventFinish/201
char zone=CapeTeriggan pos=-107,-8,452 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Zilart HeadstonePilgrimage current
keyitem WindFragment
keyitem LightFragment
keyitem FireFragment
quest Outlands.WanderingSouls completed
quest Outlands.SoulSearching completed
quest Outlands.WrathOfTheOpoOpos completed
login
trigger Cermet_Headstone                # ALREADY_OBTAINED_FRAG
warp 235,0,280 TheSanctuaryOfZitah
trigger Cermet_Headstone                # ALREADY_OBTAINED_FRAG
warp 491,20,301 YuhtungaJungle
trigger Cermet_Headstone                # ALREADY_OBTAINED_FRAG
